  "description": "FOFYAC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H80 Dy6 N16 O28 2+,4(H2 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.706-3.880 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.39-111.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6L^2_2(HCO2)4(μ3-OH)4(DMF)6(H2O)2](Cl)2·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
